## Description

DART: Detect Anything in Real Time Detect Anything in Real Time: Real-time object detection using frontier object detection models.  Training-free framework that converts SAM3 into a real-time multi-class open-vocabulary detector. Achieves 55.8 AP on COCO val2017 (80 classes) at https://t.co/fptPIoR8Xe

